<p>Thank you for the input. I have been trying to figure out what can be done to help make it better. But I'm unclear on the rules for making major edits after its been posted. I tried getting as much feed back as possible, unfortunately I was plagued by new members with opinions or no one being interested in taking the time. A few people helped immensely and to be honest they helped it became what it is now. But I was left alone for a lot of it.</p>
